Cell["\<\
\"ArrayDotTranspose\" permutes axes to a canonical layout before each \
pairwise contraction. Same numerical result as \"ArrayDot\", different \
internal representation.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a70b9da0-d7f4-458f-ac11-ab7919cec245"],

